    "Band 1 korrigiert - ~137,000 words. Date: docx created 2017-12-19, modified 2018-01-10; Lulu publication ID 22274168, and the ISBN barcode PDF is dated 2017-12-19.",
    "Band 2 korrigiert - ~120,800 words. Date: docx created and modified 2018-01-13; Lulu 22274328.",
    "Band 3 korrigiert - ~99,700 words. Date: docx created 2016-10-28, modified 2018-03-04, cp:revision 1933; Lulu 22274333.",
    "German, and Binoculars is English-tuned: more German does not substitute for English. What this buys is (a) a German baseline tight enough to be worth quoting and (b) a measurable German-versus-English gap instead of an assumed one.",
